(5559138, 803447, 61012, '<td valign="top">Challenge Relevance:7  Impact/Emotion/Mood:5  Technicals:5  Processing:6  Creativity:4							<br/> <br/>I really like the B&amp;W conversion. The clouds and sky are awesome in tone. There seems to be a softness to the focus that effects the technicals for me and the mid ground tree seems a bit too central. I''ve also checked this on two differnet monitors to see if I can see more detail in the fence line. The way it becomes lost in the shadow distracts the eye. Despite these nit picks I do like the shot; a little work on composition and focus could make an improvement.</td>', 'Challenge Relevance:7  Impact/Emotion/Mood:5  Technicals:5  Processing:6  Creativity:4							 I really like the B&W conversion. The clouds and sky are awesome in tone. There seems to be a softness to the focus that effects the technicals for me and the mid ground tree seems a bit too central. I''ve also checked this on two differnet monitors to see if I can see more detail in the fence line. The way it becomes lost in the shadow distracts the eye. Despite these nit picks I do like the shot; a little work on composition and focus could make an improvement.', '2009-07-04 14:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
