(5560716, 803189, 93696, '<td valign="top">The image looks grainy, and over saturated. I suspect that you over used the sliders for contrast, saturation and perhaps some of the lighting levels as well.</td>', 'The image looks grainy, and over saturated. I suspect that you over used the sliders for contrast, saturation and perhaps some of the lighting levels as well.', '2009-07-05 19:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560719, 803324, 93696, '<td valign="top">Personally i would crop a bit of the bottom of the legs, as there is a bit of shadow coming through there. I think the image would have been a little bit more edgy without them, and a bit more abstract as it gets harder to see that those actually are the legs. But I like the image never the less!</td>', 'Personally i would crop a bit of the bottom of the legs, as there is a bit of shadow coming through there. I think the image would have been a little bit more edgy without them, and a bit more abstract as it gets harder to see that those actually are the legs. But I like the image never the less!', '2009-07-05 19:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560727, 803259, 93696, '<td valign="top">I really like the kind of abstract pattern in this image! But personally I think the text (garden &amp; cosmos) is distracting the viewer from the main point of interest - the lines and patterns. If possible, I would have tried to find an angle where sign does not becomes part of the image.</td>', 'I really like the kind of abstract pattern in this image! But personally I think the text (garden & cosmos) is distracting the viewer from the main point of interest - the lines and patterns. If possible, I would have tried to find an angle where sign does not becomes part of the image.', '2009-07-05 19:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560736, 802922, 93696, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this image puzzles me a bit, as it looks very unnatural.</td>', 'The lighting in this image puzzles me a bit, as it looks very unnatural.', '2009-07-05 19:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560740, 803528, 93696, '<td valign="top">Personally I think that the line from the thin branch isnt interesting enough to be the main motive. If the line was leading to something, something that catches the viewers focus - it would have been better. But in this case it is the flower, but it is to small and out of focus to make it interesting.</td>', 'Personally I think that the line from the thin branch isnt interesting enough to be the main motive. If the line was leading to something, something that catches the viewers focus - it would have been better. But in this case it is the flower, but it is to small and out of focus to make it interesting.', '2009-07-05 19:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560741, 803158, 93696, '<td valign="top">I am not sure where the focus lies here, as the woman seems to be a bit blurry all over. I also suspect that you over used some of the sliders in your photoediting software as there are obvious strange outlines surrounding the hand in the front.</td>', 'I am not sure where the focus lies here, as the woman seems to be a bit blurry all over. I also suspect that you over used some of the sliders in your photoediting software as there are obvious strange outlines surrounding the hand in the front.', '2009-07-05 19:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
