(5575654, 803383, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fabulous bold shapes, and the high contrast works well to accentuate them. I also like the grain. (ISO3200 in broad daylight. I''m not sure I would have thought to do this. Wow!) <br/> <br/>I wonder if the overexposed area in the lower left doesn''t need something more -- if even a little bit of texture. I think it makes it more abstract the way it is, which is fine with me. But abstract can be a tough sell here. (Of course, my own entry was anything but abstract and ranked far lower.) <br/></td>', 'Fabulous bold shapes, and the high contrast works well to accentuate them. I also like the grain. (ISO3200 in broad daylight. I''m not sure I would have thought to do this. Wow!)  I wonder if the overexposed area in the lower left doesn''t need something more -- if even a little bit of texture. I think it makes it more abstract the way it is, which is fine with me. But abstract can be a tough sell here. (Of course, my own entry was anything but abstract and ranked far lower.) ', '2009-07-15 21:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
